WEBVTT

00:00:06.790 --> 00:00:08.080
Toujou?

00:00:08.080 --> 00:00:09.050
What's wrong?

00:00:09.490 --> 00:00:10.800
Your face is red.

00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:13.430
N-No, it's nothing.

00:00:14.310 --> 00:00:16.470
Umm, Hasegawa-sensei?

00:00:16.820 --> 00:00:18.780
Oh, Tachibana.

00:00:18.780 --> 00:00:20.560
How have you been feeling lately?

00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:21.880
R-Right.

00:00:21.880 --> 00:00:24.450
Lately I've been doing very well.

00:00:24.450 --> 00:00:26.130
It's thanks to you!

00:00:26.130 --> 00:00:27.210
I see.

00:00:27.210 --> 00:00:28.690
That's good.

00:00:30.310 --> 00:00:34.700
Okay then, good luck to both of you preparing for the sports festival.

00:00:37.680 --> 00:00:39.370
Also, Toujou...

00:00:39.630 --> 00:00:41.900
Watch out for Hasegawa-sensei.

00:00:42.730 --> 00:00:43.460
Huh?

00:00:43.460 --> 00:00:45.470
She's beautiful, intelligent,

00:00:45.470 --> 00:00:47.650
and a kind teacher.

00:00:47.650 --> 00:00:50.460
But unfortunately in this world,

00:00:50.810 --> 00:00:54.220
being good and proper isn't enough to make you liked.

00:00:54.220 --> 00:00:57.510
That's why people always have someone who hates them.

00:00:58.040 --> 00:01:00.520
Yet Hasegawa-sensei doesn't.

00:01:01.050 --> 00:01:03.200
Everyone likes her.

00:01:03.690 --> 00:01:05.250
Everyone...

00:01:06.410 --> 00:01:09.680
It's as though she's using some kind of magic.

00:02:50.640 --> 00:02:52.740
This is kind of exciting, isn't it?

00:02:53.210 --> 00:02:55.480
Isn't it a little cold today?

00:02:55.480 --> 00:02:57.340
You think so?

00:02:58.430 --> 00:03:00.660
When you're cold, have some of Shiho's meat buns!

00:03:00.660 --> 00:03:03.530
Hey, hey! Stop that!

00:03:05.370 --> 00:03:06.690
Good morning.

00:03:07.350 --> 00:03:08.550
Please take this.

00:03:11.220 --> 00:03:14.170
I guess that just about does it for the guests.

00:03:14.170 --> 00:03:15.980
Yeah, I think so.

00:03:16.580 --> 00:03:19.490
Still, I was worried there for a while,

00:03:20.250 --> 00:03:23.540
but Donoue-senpai and his gang willingly apologized.

00:03:24.520 --> 00:03:27.400
I'm glad that was resolved in time.

00:03:28.510 --> 00:03:29.120
Yeah.

00:03:30.310 --> 00:03:31.510
What's wrong?

00:03:31.510 --> 00:03:33.130
Not feeling well?

00:03:34.670 --> 00:03:36.230
That's not it.

00:03:37.740 --> 00:03:38.830
Hey!

00:03:38.830 --> 00:03:40.790
Looks like you found us without getting lost.

00:03:40.790 --> 00:03:41.970
Are you an idiot?

00:03:42.320 --> 00:03:44.440
How would I ever get lost

00:03:44.440 --> 00:03:46.470
when this is the school Onee attends?

00:03:47.300 --> 00:03:50.100
This girl's my childhood friend, and Yuki's—

00:03:50.710 --> 00:03:53.110
The little sister of Nonaka from our class.

00:03:53.970 --> 00:03:57.230
Kurumi, this a fellow member of the executive committee, Tachibana.

00:03:58.560 --> 00:03:59.490
Pleased to meet you.

00:04:00.540 --> 00:04:01.490
Hello.

00:04:05.070 --> 00:04:07.290
She's just a bit shy.

00:04:07.290 --> 00:04:09.580
It's not that she doesn't like you.

00:04:10.750 --> 00:04:11.360
Yeah.

00:04:12.500 --> 00:04:14.040
Time to switch.

00:04:14.040 --> 00:04:14.870
Okay.

00:04:14.870 --> 00:04:15.750
Later then.

00:04:15.750 --> 00:04:17.130
We'll leave it to you.

00:04:18.480 --> 00:04:20.810
There's some places I want to stop by first,

00:04:20.810 --> 00:04:22.430
so I'll see you again later.

00:04:22.430 --> 00:04:23.910
Yeah, later.

00:04:25.900 --> 00:04:28.030
Basara, where's Kurumi?

00:04:28.030 --> 00:04:29.350
She's already here.

00:04:29.350 --> 00:04:31.440
She should've entered the grounds earlier.

00:04:31.440 --> 00:04:32.630
I see.

00:04:32.630 --> 00:04:34.290
Then it's finally time.

00:04:34.290 --> 00:04:35.060
Yeah.

00:04:36.160 --> 00:04:39.570
There certainly are demons that can manipulate people.

00:04:39.930 --> 00:04:40.800
But...

00:04:40.800 --> 00:04:44.950
I've never heard of normal people being granted magic power.

00:04:45.330 --> 00:04:46.950
If it's a high-ranking demon

00:04:46.950 --> 00:04:50.330
or someone with great skills and abilities, then it might be possible.

00:04:54.220 --> 00:04:57.100
It's someone who won't let us sense their presence,

00:04:57.100 --> 00:04:58.710
so we can't let our guard down.

00:04:58.980 --> 00:05:01.520
But if they're going to attack again...

00:05:01.520 --> 00:05:04.610
It'll most likely be today, as there are 
plenty of people available to manipulate.

00:05:05.150 --> 00:05:06.170
Listen,

00:05:06.170 --> 00:05:08.630
our first priority is the lives of everyone at school.

00:05:09.830 --> 00:05:12.270
We can't afford to allow even one casualty.

00:05:13.070 --> 00:05:13.790
Yeah.

00:05:13.790 --> 00:05:14.900
Of course.

00:05:20.240 --> 00:05:23.740
We, the students, do hereby pledge

00:05:24.160 --> 00:05:28.740
to use all the knowledge and experience we have gained here at school,

00:05:29.220 --> 00:05:35.120
along with the healthy bodies
 and minds cultivated at school,

00:05:35.120 --> 00:05:39.590
to compete fairly and honorably with each other.

00:05:40.150 --> 00:05:42.760
I say this as your representative, Kajiura Rikka!

00:05:43.330 --> 00:05:48.390
<i>Way to go! President!</i>

00:05:48.880 --> 00:05:50.650
Let's also start...

00:05:50.650 --> 00:05:52.130
our own battle.

00:05:54.550 --> 00:05:58.740
<i>Classes 1-A through 1-E make up five teams, and select four competitors each.{Classes 1-A through 1-E make up five teams, and each class selected four competitors.}</i>

00:05:58.740 --> 00:06:02.530
<i>With the first competition ahead, each team is fired up to score the most points!</i>

00:06:03.390 --> 00:06:05.180
Spirits of air,

00:06:06.410 --> 00:06:07.460
please.

00:06:12.790 --> 00:06:16.500
<i>We will now begin the first competition.</i>

00:06:14.260 --> 00:06:16.500
Come on, don't delay!

00:06:16.500 --> 00:06:18.540
<i>Will the freshmen please gather at their designated positions.</i>

00:06:16.800 --> 00:06:18.540
Hurry up!

00:06:24.670 --> 00:06:26.800
Investigate these grounds.

00:06:26.800 --> 00:06:30.180
If you see anyone acting suspicious, alert me at once.

00:06:38.360 --> 00:06:39.940
I knew it.

00:07:01.600 --> 00:07:06.660
<i>Next up, the mixed-gender four-legged obstacle-course race!</i>

00:07:06.660 --> 00:07:08.270
<i>The team to watch is Class 1-B,</i>

00:07:08.270 --> 00:07:12.470
<i>the one with two of this academy's idols participating.</i>

00:07:10.690 --> 00:07:12.470
Any word from Kurumi-chan?

00:07:12.470 --> 00:07:13.530
<i>Mio-chan!</i>

00:07:12.470 --> 00:07:13.530
Not yet.

00:07:13.530 --> 00:07:16.170
I hope the spirits are enough of a deterrent.

00:07:14.540 --> 00:07:16.170
<i>Yuki-hime!</i>

00:07:16.170 --> 00:07:18.130
<i>Go to hell, Toujou!</i>

00:07:16.170 --> 00:07:18.130
I know we can't let our guard down,

00:07:20.620 --> 00:07:23.620
but let's enjoy this while we're at it.

00:07:28.420 --> 00:07:30.990
<i>All the classes are off!</i>

00:07:31.950 --> 00:07:33.680
<i>They've started off neck-and-neck!</i>

00:07:34.490 --> 00:07:37.000
<i>Which will be the first team to break away?</i>

00:07:37.000 --> 00:07:37.700
Dumbass!

00:07:37.700 --> 00:07:38.670
Die!

00:07:38.670 --> 00:07:40.000
Pervert!

00:07:39.140 --> 00:07:43.050
<i>Oh, the team to watch out for is already leaving the other classes behind,</i>

00:07:43.050 --> 00:07:45.630
<i>and steadily increasing its pace!</i>

00:07:45.630 --> 00:07:46.880
What?

00:07:46.880 --> 00:07:48.230
No, umm...

00:07:49.010 --> 00:07:50.210
I-It's nothing!

00:07:51.010 --> 00:07:52.850
Y-Yuki! You—

00:07:52.850 --> 00:07:55.010
This way reduces resistance.

00:07:55.920 --> 00:07:56.890
Ahh, jeez!

00:07:57.470 --> 00:08:00.520
<i>The leaders are quickly reaching the first checkpoint!</i>

00:08:01.950 --> 00:08:03.150
Go on, good luck!

00:08:01.950 --> 00:08:05.840
<i>Now, the three of them must work together to break the balloons!</i>

00:08:05.840 --> 00:08:08.240
<i>This is one of the best parts about all three working together!</i>

00:08:11.740 --> 00:08:13.020
S-Sorry!

00:08:16.160 --> 00:08:17.080
H-Hey?!

00:08:17.080 --> 00:08:19.090
Basara, hurry.

00:08:19.660 --> 00:08:21.250
Hold on!

00:08:22.420 --> 00:08:23.250
Huh?!

00:08:24.420 --> 00:08:26.470
Hold on. Don't rush!

00:08:27.890 --> 00:08:28.920
Hey!

00:08:31.660 --> 00:08:33.110
Hey!

00:08:33.110 --> 00:08:34.190
You two!

00:08:34.890 --> 00:08:36.050
Settle down!

00:08:37.130 --> 00:08:38.930
Hold on!

00:08:38.930 --> 00:08:40.220
Die!

00:08:40.220 --> 00:08:41.330
I'm too jealous!

00:08:41.330 --> 00:08:43.240
What the hell are you doing?!

00:08:43.240 --> 00:08:44.560
<i>Oh! This is ero—</i>

00:08:44.560 --> 00:08:46.770
<i>I mean, beautiful!</i>

00:08:46.770 --> 00:08:49.730
<i>It looks like the two girls are using Toujou-kun</i>

00:08:49.730 --> 00:08:52.640
<i>as a pole to dance around!</i>

00:08:52.640 --> 00:08:54.450
This stupid commentator!

00:08:58.480 --> 00:08:59.830
So hot!

00:09:12.080 --> 00:09:13.320
H-Hey!

00:09:36.110 --> 00:09:37.370
Wh-What?!

00:09:38.030 --> 00:09:39.620
I'm sorry.

00:09:39.620 --> 00:09:42.370
I'm dragging us down.

00:09:42.370 --> 00:09:44.030
F-Forgive me.

00:09:49.710 --> 00:09:51.510
Onii-chan...

00:09:51.880 --> 00:09:52.910
Basara...

00:09:54.660 --> 00:09:56.510
Please...

00:10:04.650 --> 00:10:05.820
Just hold on!

00:10:06.980 --> 00:10:10.400
I'll do something fast!

00:10:11.350 --> 00:10:16.150
And maybe something like that's happening right now?

00:10:16.150 --> 00:10:18.080
Ah, I want to watch!

00:10:18.080 --> 00:10:20.500
I want to watch from front-row seats!

00:10:23.110 --> 00:10:25.060
<i>Goal!</i>

00:10:28.350 --> 00:10:32.550
<i>The big favorite, Class B, wins with the others far behind!</i>

00:10:32.550 --> 00:10:33.690
We did it!

00:10:33.690 --> 00:10:34.380
Yeah!

00:10:37.710 --> 00:10:38.800
First place, huh?

00:10:39.130 --> 00:10:40.060
Congratulations.

00:10:41.790 --> 00:10:42.680
Thanks.

00:10:45.600 --> 00:10:46.640
Excuse us.

00:10:49.280 --> 00:10:52.690
I need to protect everyone.

00:10:53.290 --> 00:10:56.450
Even if it means suspecting that woman.

00:11:00.700 --> 00:11:03.060
<i>Next up is creative dance,</i>

00:11:03.060 --> 00:11:04.580
<i>requested by our women.</i>

00:11:04.580 --> 00:11:07.460
<i>These ladies have practiced late into the night every day.</i>

00:11:07.970 --> 00:11:09.460
<i>Please enjoy their wonderful performances!</i>

00:11:19.500 --> 00:11:20.450
This guy?!

00:11:40.190 --> 00:11:41.570
Donoue-senpai is...

00:11:42.280 --> 00:11:43.080
Why?!

00:11:45.410 --> 00:11:47.850
Where did he come from?!

00:11:49.760 --> 00:11:51.210
I'll stop him!

00:11:51.900 --> 00:11:53.130
You two protect everyone!

00:11:53.130 --> 00:11:54.090
Leave it to me!

00:11:54.090 --> 00:11:55.130
Got it!

00:11:59.820 --> 00:12:02.010
Banishing Shift!

00:12:10.370 --> 00:12:11.390
Toujou-kun?!

00:12:20.620 --> 00:12:21.280
Calm down!

00:12:21.620 --> 00:12:23.820
Please follow directions and evacuate!

00:12:23.820 --> 00:12:24.660
Hurry!

00:12:26.040 --> 00:12:27.290
Don't stay here!

00:12:27.290 --> 00:12:28.110
It's dangerous!

00:12:29.870 --> 00:12:31.370
It's all right now.

00:12:31.370 --> 00:12:32.650
You did well.

00:12:34.670 --> 00:12:36.580
Banishing Shift!

00:12:39.040 --> 00:12:40.120
Who?!

00:12:41.130 --> 00:12:42.900
Who pulled this reckless stunt?!

00:12:54.110 --> 00:12:55.070
Tachibana?!

00:12:56.240 --> 00:12:57.120
You...

00:12:59.780 --> 00:13:00.630
A barrier?!

00:13:13.640 --> 00:13:15.770
Those red eyes...

00:13:16.680 --> 00:13:18.800
Is he a vampire?!

00:13:27.330 --> 00:13:28.490
What?

00:13:28.490 --> 00:13:30.060
That was awfully easy.

00:13:30.880 --> 00:13:33.110
Is he also being manipulated?

00:13:34.700 --> 00:13:36.290
There's this sensation, as well.

00:13:39.620 --> 00:13:40.190
Huh?!

00:13:45.020 --> 00:13:45.710
Huh?

00:13:46.570 --> 00:13:47.970
What?

00:13:48.580 --> 00:13:49.810
What?

00:13:54.210 --> 00:13:58.390
Was this all your doing, Tachibana?

00:14:00.420 --> 00:14:03.690
I thought you wanted to make the sports festival a success!

00:14:03.690 --> 00:14:06.610
Cut the fun and games, you bald-faced liar.

00:14:07.340 --> 00:14:10.470
I know you came here to kill me!

00:14:14.460 --> 00:14:15.230
He's fast!

00:14:18.090 --> 00:14:19.360
Brynhildr!

00:14:28.990 --> 00:14:31.040
Why are you heroes all like that?!

00:14:31.480 --> 00:14:34.000
Always trying to kill us for no reason!

00:14:35.190 --> 00:14:36.000
I just...

00:14:36.390 --> 00:14:40.500
I just wanted to live a quiet life!

00:14:46.290 --> 00:14:47.840
Those tears...

00:14:47.840 --> 00:14:50.530
Is Tachibana really the mastermind behind all this?

00:15:02.490 --> 00:15:03.480
Can you get in?

00:15:04.680 --> 00:15:07.810
Right now I'm searching for a crack in the barrier with Sakuya.

00:15:10.090 --> 00:15:11.000
Basara,

00:15:12.110 --> 00:15:14.550
where on earth are you?

00:15:24.180 --> 00:15:26.050
Both of their presences disappeared?!

00:15:26.340 --> 00:15:27.630
What's going on?!

00:15:28.930 --> 00:15:30.230
The nurse's office!

00:15:44.900 --> 00:15:46.560
Sorry, Tachibana!

00:15:50.230 --> 00:15:52.650
Hold on, Mio! Yuki!

00:16:02.400 --> 00:16:04.620
Watch out for Hasegawa-sensei.

00:16:05.350 --> 00:16:07.680
So it is you.

00:16:10.240 --> 00:16:11.240
Sensei...

00:16:11.240 --> 00:16:14.110
Mio and Yuki should be up ahead.

00:16:14.110 --> 00:16:15.470
Please let me through.

00:16:15.980 --> 00:16:18.070
Sorry, but I can't do that.

00:16:18.070 --> 00:16:18.850
Please move!

00:16:32.540 --> 00:16:33.780
What power!

00:16:34.480 --> 00:16:36.410
So she really is...

00:16:51.700 --> 00:16:52.840
This way, Toujou!

00:16:53.210 --> 00:16:54.070
Sakasaki-sensei?!

00:16:54.070 --> 00:16:55.890
Quit wasting time and come!

00:17:08.310 --> 00:17:10.010
Don't get full of yourself.

00:17:14.080 --> 00:17:16.140
I set up several barriers.

00:17:16.140 --> 00:17:18.120
It should be enough to slow her down at least.

00:17:19.210 --> 00:17:20.650
Thanks a lot.

00:17:21.400 --> 00:17:23.830
But Sakasaki-sensei, why are you...?

00:17:23.830 --> 00:17:26.630
Actually, Jin and I are old acquaintances.

00:17:26.630 --> 00:17:30.000
He asked me to keep an eye out for you

00:17:30.000 --> 00:17:32.050
while he was away in the demon world.

00:17:32.630 --> 00:17:34.010
You know my father?

00:17:34.010 --> 00:17:36.020
I'm a freelance exorcist.

00:17:36.580 --> 00:17:39.890
I know enough about your circumstances.

00:17:40.320 --> 00:17:41.950
I see.

00:17:44.130 --> 00:17:45.500
Please tell me.

00:17:45.500 --> 00:17:49.280
What on earth is Hasegawa-sensei?

00:17:52.490 --> 00:17:54.780
I don't know her true identity, either.

00:17:55.080 --> 00:18:00.030
All I know is she possesses power on par with S-class demons,

00:18:02.290 --> 00:18:06.440
and that she's trying to rule this academy from the shadows.

00:18:07.670 --> 00:18:10.090
Then Donoue-senpai and the others...

00:18:10.090 --> 00:18:11.130
Yeah.

00:18:11.420 --> 00:18:13.590
She was manipulating them with magic.

00:18:14.030 --> 00:18:15.680
She's also the one who caused Tachibana to

00:18:15.680 --> 00:18:18.540
turn hostile toward you and try to attack you.

00:18:20.110 --> 00:18:22.060
We can't waste too much time.

00:18:22.060 --> 00:18:24.180
Right now, everyone involved in this academy is

00:18:24.180 --> 00:18:27.030
practically being held hostage by Hasegawa.

00:18:28.090 --> 00:18:31.260
We need to prepare our counterattack as soon as possible.

00:18:32.040 --> 00:18:33.360
Right.

00:18:38.290 --> 00:18:39.700
What's with you, Toujou?!

00:18:39.950 --> 00:18:43.100
Do you think I'm being manipulated by Hasegawa-sensei, too?

00:18:43.770 --> 00:18:44.870
No.

00:18:44.870 --> 00:18:49.080
I finally realized you're our enemy.

00:18:49.080 --> 00:18:50.710
Wh-What are you saying?

00:18:50.710 --> 00:18:53.340
If Hasegawa-sensei were that big of a threat,

00:18:53.880 --> 00:18:56.970
my father would've taken some
 measures against her, no doubt.

00:18:57.500 --> 00:19:01.030
Such as transferring Mio to the school I used to go to.

00:19:01.520 --> 00:19:05.330
At the very least, there's no way he wouldn't have told me about any threat to our lives!

00:19:06.740 --> 00:19:10.460
There's no mistake that my father
 noticed Hasegawa-sensei's presence.

00:19:10.460 --> 00:19:12.440
Since he said nothing about her,

00:19:12.440 --> 00:19:14.560
it means she's never been our enemy.

00:19:14.560 --> 00:19:15.610
Toujou...

00:19:16.020 --> 00:19:19.290
You're the mastermind, Sakasaki-sensei.

00:19:22.360 --> 00:19:24.620
You got me.

00:19:30.090 --> 00:19:31.630
You're tough.

00:19:32.190 --> 00:19:34.740
As I'd expect from the hero clan.

00:19:37.160 --> 00:19:39.340
Doesn't look as though we have much time.

00:19:39.340 --> 00:19:40.380
Oh, well.

00:19:48.290 --> 00:19:49.800
That form?!

00:19:49.800 --> 00:19:50.900
It can't be!

00:19:50.900 --> 00:19:52.110
That's right.

00:19:52.110 --> 00:19:54.810
Even though you were exiled from the village,

00:19:54.810 --> 00:19:58.900
you should understand what this form means, Toujou.

00:19:58.900 --> 00:20:02.220
We gods are the true source of everything.

00:20:02.220 --> 00:20:07.590
The losers driven out of heaven turned into demons and built the demon world.

00:20:07.590 --> 00:20:10.870
And those demons are invading the human world

00:20:10.870 --> 00:20:15.920
as a step toward exacting their revenge upon the gods.

00:20:16.360 --> 00:20:24.430
There are also humans bestowed with power to stop the demons' advance.

00:20:26.180 --> 00:20:29.180
You, the heroes, are those humans.

00:20:29.910 --> 00:20:34.230
Now, do you know what you ought to do before me?

00:20:34.870 --> 00:20:35.830
I'll...

00:20:35.830 --> 00:20:37.320
Kneel, now!

00:20:44.320 --> 00:20:45.570
Fool.

00:20:57.630 --> 00:21:02.350
You think a mere hero can oppose the gods?

00:21:02.870 --> 00:21:05.220
Unfortunately for you, I'm not a hero anymore.

00:21:05.540 --> 00:21:08.820
I'll take on anyone in order to protect those I care about!

00:21:10.470 --> 00:21:11.390
Kurumi?!

00:21:11.840 --> 00:21:13.400
"Protect those you care about"?

00:21:13.400 --> 00:21:15.480
Do you mean this thing?

00:21:16.970 --> 00:21:18.110
Bastard!

00:21:18.530 --> 00:21:19.740
What have you done?!

00:21:21.480 --> 00:21:22.630
Don't worry.

00:21:22.630 --> 00:21:25.110
I haven't done anything...

00:21:25.690 --> 00:21:27.240
yet.

00:21:28.120 --> 00:21:31.360
Now, do you understand what you must do?

00:21:31.360 --> 00:21:33.620
Don't you have any pride as a god?

00:21:33.850 --> 00:21:37.630
It's the owner's prerogative to do as they please with heroes, isn't it?

00:21:39.460 --> 00:21:41.590
Now, what will you do?

00:21:46.230 --> 00:21:47.100
Fine...
